{
  "description": "First 30 original ASR cues, unchanged; clocks contain known legacy packing conflicts. Gold is evaluation-only.",
  "source": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.21,
      "end": 2.67,
      "text": "据说这个世界掺杂着伟人，"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 3.19,
      "end": 4.63,
      "text": "他们可以是你的同学、"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 5.09,
      "end": 5.89,
      "text": "你的亲人，"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 6.21,
      "end": 7.93,
      "text": "甚至是你自己。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 8.65,
      "end": 11.09,
      "text": "他们不再只是伪装他们在成长，"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 11.09,
      "end": 11.75,
      "text": "在进化，"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 12.05,
      "end": 13.83,
      "text": "在寻找那些完美的容器，"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 14.07,
      "end": 15.81,
      "text": "请找出他们或者活"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 16.83,
      "end": 17.61,
      "text": "下去，祝"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 18.11,
      "end": 19.355,
      "text": "你们好运松姜嗯。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 22.18,
      "end": 22.7,
      "text": "蔓，"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 23.42,
      "end": 23.94,
      "text": "延嘿。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 23.94,
      "end": 24.02,
      "text": "盐。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 26.14,
      "end": 26.38,
      "text": "哥，"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 27.2,
      "end": 29.865,
      "text": "们有火吗来一？"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 31.675,
      "end": 31.78,
      "text": "来。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 31.78,
      "end": 32.32,
      "text": "根谢谢，"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 32.86,
      "end": 33.28,
      "text": "我不。"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 33.42,
      "end": 34.1,
      "text": "抽烟出车"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 34.62,
      "end": 35.34,
      "text": "祸了吗这是？"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 35.34,
      "end": 36.86,
      "text": "没出车祸只有，"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 37.18,
      "end": 39.08,
      "text": "几个条子在这里设卡受巧为"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 39.44,
      "end": 40.76,
      "text": "什，么大概？"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 41.02,
      "end": 42.78,
      "text": "是因为刚颁布的戒严令最近，"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 44.28,
      "text": "条子都封了查这，"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 44.58,
      "end": 45.54,
      "text": "查那的听到。"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 45.82,
      "end": 46.62,
      "text": "这话阿 k，"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 46.9,
      "end": 49.58,
      "text": "忽然想起了北边最近出现大量骚乱的"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 49.58,
      "end": 50.44,
      "text": "新闻有不，"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 50.62,
      "end": 52.54,
      "text": "少人已经往南边跑网络。"
    }
  ],
  "gold": [
    {
      "index": 1,
